	"version" "3"
	"title" "Interstate 76 - Option 2 v9 (shared pad layer)"
	"description" "Gamepad for the shared i76-remap.ahk pad layer (same as Windows/Mac: analog driving, Y view cycle, LB shift layer), plus Deck extras: grips L4 front target, L5 nearest target, R4 hardpoint 3, R5 hardpoints 4+5; left trackpad menu; right trackpad mouse, press = click. Launch the Interstate 76 (pad layer) library entry."
